<div class="description en" dir="ltr" lang="en"><span class="language en" title="English"><b>English&#58; </b></span> The monument on the Geographical Centre of New Zealand, a hilltop overlooking <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nelson,_New_Zealand" class="extiw" title="en:Nelson, New Zealand">Nelson</a> (starting point for the original trigonometrical surveys of the South Island).</div></td>
